        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "The pump track is really fun the skatepark is alright it’s not bad has abit of everything i geuss but it’s missing something I feel like",
        "time": 1760212853,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Neil Gillies",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101189340459518042966/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTf8sofGxJlXCOJe1Ns_8rYuIgoj-XBIFTXT_4zoDiLwKyJ51U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "This brand new skatepark & pumptrack had some serious funding and it shows. It's the real deal! Absolutely nailed the design & layout, such a cool place to skate! The pavement is smooth as butter and everything glides & slides perfectly.\nThere is something for every experience level from beginner to pro which makes it a top-tier skatepark for all ages!\nRails, quarter-pipes, ramps, boxes, curbs, ledges, stairs & even a mini half-pipe!!\nBeyond impressed with the finished product.\n\nThe only \"downside\" is the skatepark could really benefit from some outdoor lighting fixtures for night sessions, every other sport has them at the park... ( Soccer, Baseball, Tennis )\n\nGo check it out for yourself, you will absolutely not be dissapointed - Guaranteed!!\n#1 SKATEPARK off island ☆☆☆☆☆",
        "time": 1692851943,
        "translated": false
      },
